        "P0 Detect → P1 Recon → P2 Hunt → P3 Judge",
        "→ P4 Prove → P5 Critique → P6 Report",
        "one question after the estimate",
        "budget check before each wave; resume",
        "agents save + ledger mark, no hand edits",
        "critic-check decisions; writes findings.json"
      ]
